    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"110064\">Kenny Lau</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/reuse.20previous.20goals.3F/near/523914802\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">refine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reused</span>\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>A variation on this which avoids some of the issues around hygiene with named metavariables is:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">refine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?_;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reused</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 524939719,
        "sender_full_name": "Mario Carneiro",
        "timestamp": 1750362244
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I'm not sure if this is the right place to post this. I was recently trying to use <code>mvcgen</code> and noticed that in the tutorial <a href=\"https://lean-lang.org/doc/tutorials/4.32.0-rc1//mvcgen/\">Verifying Imperative Programs Using mvcgen</a> the theorem <code>nodup_correct_directly</code> seems to \"abuse\" metavariables in this way with <code>?lhs</code>. Am I correct that this is still fragile and should be avoided? </p>\n<p>I came up with a contrived example how it could go wrong, but I'm curious if there are other ways to break it:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Do</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nodup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Id</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">seen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashSet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∅</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">seen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">seen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">seen</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">insert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lhs</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: Application type mismatch: The argument</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  ?lhs</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">has type</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  (have seen := seen;</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        do</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        let __s ←</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">          forIn l (none, seen) fun x __s =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">              have seen := __s.snd;</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">              if x ∈ seen then pure (ForInStep.done (some false, seen))</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">              else</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">                have seen := seen.insert x;</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">                pure (ForInStep.yield (none, seen))</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        have __r : Option Bool := __s.fst</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        match __r with</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">          | some r =&gt; pure r</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">          | none =&gt; pure true).run =</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">      true ↔</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    l.Nodup</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">of sort `Prop` but is expected to have type</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  Prop</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">of sort `Type` in the application</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  Iff ?lhs</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nodup_correct_directly</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nodup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nodup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">nodup</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">generalize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hseen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∅</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashSet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">seen</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lhs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lhs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">change</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">lhs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nodup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- ?lhs breaks here</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">suffices</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">lhs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nodup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∉</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">seen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">clear</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hseen</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">generalizing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">seen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Id</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run_pure</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Id</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run_bind</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I found a slightly less contrived example and have no idea why <code>?a</code> breaks</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">eraseAll</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">xs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Id</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xs</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cur</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xs</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">erase</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">while</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">!=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cur</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">prev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cur</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cur</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cur</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">erase</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cur</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">eraseAll_correct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">eraseAll</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w